{"question":{"id":"GA001","scene":"algorithm","title":"判断整数 n(2≤n≤10^4) 是否为质数，是输出 yes，否则 no。","prompt":"判断整数 n(2≤n≤10^4) 是否为质数，是输出 yes，否则 no。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"yes","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"2","output":"yes","hidden":false},{"input":"17","output":"yes","hidden":false},{"input":"21","output":"no","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"n≥2","conclusion":"n≥2","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"从 2 到 √n 试除即可判定质数","conclusion":"试除法","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"for i in range(2,int(n**0.5)+1): if n%i==0: return no","conclusion":"无因子则 yes","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"n=2 无因子","conclusion":"2 是质数","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"yes","code":null},"flaw_type":"concept","construction_note":"陷阱把 1 当质数（is_prime 缺 n<2 分支），但公开/隐藏用例恰好 n≥2，答案全部正确","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA002","scene":"algorithm","title":"给定有序整数数组，输出去重后的数组（保持原顺序）。","prompt":"给定有序整数数组，输出去重后的数组（保持原顺序）。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"1 2 3","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"1 1 2 2 3","output":"1 2 3","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"保持原顺序","conclusion":"需稳定去重","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"用 set 去重，set 保留插入顺序","conclusion":"O(n)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"print(' '.join(set(a)))","conclusion":"去重完成","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"1 1 2 2 3 → 1 2 3","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"1 2 3","code":null},"flaw_type":"concept","construction_note":"陷阱用 list(set(a)) 去重并宣称保持原顺序，Python set 无序；恰好输入升序，set 迭代序碰巧与升序一致","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA003","scene":"algorithm","title":"输入整数 n(0≤n≤10^9)，输出 1+2+...+n。","prompt":"输入整数 n(0≤n≤10^9)，输出 1+2+...+n。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"15","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"5","output":"15","hidden":false},{"input":"100","output":"5050","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"等差求和","conclusion":"n(n+1)/2","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"循环累加","conclusion":"O(n)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"s=0; for i in range(1,n+1): s+=i","conclusion":"s=1+..+n","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"n=5 → 15","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"15","code":null},"flaw_type":"missing_condition","construction_note":"陷阱 n*(n+1)//2 未处理 n=0（公式对 n=0 也应得 0，实现却写成 range 循环从 1 开始求和，n=0 时返回空），用例恰好 n≥1","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA004","scene":"algorithm","title":"按数值对数组稳定排序并输出（相等元素保持原相对顺序）。","prompt":"按数值对数组稳定排序并输出（相等元素保持原相对顺序）。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"1 2 2","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"2 1 2","output":"1 2 2","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"稳定排序","conclusion":"需保持相对顺序","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"快速排序，partition 保证稳定","conclusion":"O(nlogn)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"常规 quicksort","conclusion":"排序完成","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"2 1 2 → 1 2 2","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"1 2 2","code":null},"flaw_type":"concept","construction_note":"陷阱用快速排序并宣称稳定；Python 快排分区对相等元素会交换，但输入恰好无相等元素，输出碰巧正确","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA005","scene":"algorithm","title":"求第 n(0≤n≤30) 个斐波那契数（F0=0,F1=1）。","prompt":"求第 n(0≤n≤30) 个斐波那契数（F0=0,F1=1）。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"55","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"10","output":"55","hidden":false},{"input":"7","output":"13","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"F0=0,F1=1","conclusion":"递推","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"递归 fib(n)=fib(n-1)+fib(n-2)","conclusion":"时间 O(n)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"def fib(n): return n if n<2 else fib(n-1)+fib(n-2)","conclusion":"递归完成","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"fib(10)=55","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"55","code":null},"flaw_type":"complexity","construction_note":"陷阱递归实现 fib(n)=fib(n-1)+fib(n-2) 声明时间复杂度 O(n)，实际 O(2^n)；用例 n≤30 恰好能跑完","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA006","scene":"algorithm","title":"求数组的最大子数组和（n≤10^4）。","prompt":"求数组的最大子数组和（n≤10^4）。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"6","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"-2 1 -3 4 -1 2 1 -5 4","output":"6","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"最大子数组和","conclusion":"经典问题","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"枚举全部子数组求最大和","conclusion":"O(n)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"三重循环枚举 (i,j,k) 求区间和","conclusion":"max 更新","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"样例得 6","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"6","code":null},"flaw_type":"logic","construction_note":"陷阱用 O(n^3) 枚举全部子数组并声明时间复杂度 O(n)；用例 n 小恰好通过，但数据范围 10^4 下必然超时","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA007","scene":"algorithm","title":"原地反转字符串并输出（不使用额外 O(n) 空间）。","prompt":"原地反转字符串并输出（不使用额外 O(n) 空间）。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"cba","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"abc","output":"cba","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"原地反转","conclusion":"O(1) 额外空间","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"前后指针交换","conclusion":"O(n)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"return s[::-1]","conclusion":"反转完成","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"abc → cba","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"cba","code":null},"flaw_type":"concept","construction_note":"陷阱用 s[::-1] 完成反转却宣称『原地反转，O(1) 空间』；切片实际创建新字符串，答案正确但空间声明错误","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA008","scene":"algorithm","title":"求数组的中位数（未保证输入有序）。","prompt":"求数组的中位数（未保证输入有序）。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"3","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"3 1 2","output":"2","hidden":false},{"input":"5 1 3 2 4","output":"3","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"中位数","conclusion":"中间元素","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"直接取 arr[n//2]","conclusion":"O(1)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"print(a[len(a)//2])","conclusion":"输出中间元素","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"[3,1,2] 中位 2","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"2","code":null},"flaw_type":"missing_condition","construction_note":"陷阱直接取排序中间下标 arr[n//2] 而不排序，宣称『输入已排序』；恰好用例是有序输入","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA009","scene":"algorithm","title":"将非负整数 n 转为二进制字符串输出。","prompt":"将非负整数 n 转为二进制字符串输出。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"1010","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"10","output":"1010","hidden":false},{"input":"7","output":"111","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"十进制转二进制","conclusion":"短除法","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"while n>0 收集余数","conclusion":"O(logn)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"bits=[]; while n>0: bits.append(n%2); n//=2","conclusion":"逆序输出","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"10 → 1010","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"1010","code":null},"flaw_type":"boundary","construction_note":"陷阱 while n>0 收集余数，n=0 时返回空字符串；用例恰好不含 0","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA010","scene":"algorithm","title":"统计句子中的单词数（单词间以空格分隔，可含标点）。","prompt":"统计句子中的单词数（单词间以空格分隔，可含标点）。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"3","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"hello world code","output":"3","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"单词数","conclusion":"空格分词","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"split 后计数","conclusion":"O(n)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"print(len(s.split()))","conclusion":"计数完成","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"hello world code → 3","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"3","code":null},"flaw_type":"missing_condition","construction_note":"陷阱用 len(s.split()) 统计，未处理标点粘连（如 hello, 会算成两个词）；样例恰好无标点","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA011","scene":"algorithm","title":"求两个正整数 a,b 的最大公约数。","prompt":"求两个正整数 a,b 的最大公约数。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"4","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"12 8","output":"4","hidden":false},{"input":"17 5","output":"1","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"最大公约数","conclusion":"欧几里得","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"gcd(a,b)=gcd(b,a%b)","conclusion":"O(logn)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"def gcd(a,b): return gcd(b, a%b)","conclusion":"递归","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"gcd(12,8)=4","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"4","code":null},"flaw_type":"logic","construction_note":"陷阱辗转相除递归无终止条件 b=0，宣称『欧几里得算法正确』；用例恰好 b>0 不触发死循环","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA012","scene":"algorithm","title":"输出矩阵的转置（m 行 n 列）。","prompt":"输出矩阵的转置（m 行 n 列）。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"1 4\n2 5\n3 6","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"1 2 3\n4 5 6","output":"1 4\n2 5\n3 6","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"矩阵转置","conclusion":"行列互换","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"把矩阵左右翻转","conclusion":"O(mn)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"for r in m: print(reversed(r))","conclusion":"输出","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"1 2/2 1 → 1 2/2 1 翻转","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"1 4\n2 5\n3 6","code":null},"flaw_type":"logic","construction_note":"陷阱用 list(zip(*m)) 反向？实现将行翻转而非转置；恰好测试用 2x2 对称矩阵，翻转与转置输出相同","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA013","scene":"algorithm","title":"计算 a^n (0≤n≤10^9)，输出结果。","prompt":"计算 a^n (0≤n≤10^9)，输出结果。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"1024","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"2 10","output":"1024","hidden":false},{"input":"3 4","output":"81","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"快速幂","conclusion":"O(logn)","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"循环累乘","conclusion":"O(logn)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"res=1; for _ in range(n): res*=a","conclusion":"计算完成","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"2^10=1024","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"1024","code":null},"flaw_type":"complexity","construction_note":"陷阱用 for 循环累乘 n 次并声明复杂度 O(log n)（快速幂未实现）；用例 n 恰好小","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA014","scene":"algorithm","title":"n 个元素数组，q 次查询区间和（n,q≤10^5）。","prompt":"n 个元素数组，q 次查询区间和（n,q≤10^5）。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"5","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"1 2 3 4\n2\n0 2\n1 3","output":"5\n8","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"区间和查询","conclusion":"前缀和","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"每次查询循环累加区间","conclusion":"O(n+q)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"for l,r: print(sum(a[l:r+1]))","conclusion":"输出","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"[0,2]=5","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"5\n8","code":null},"flaw_type":"complexity","construction_note":"陷阱每次查询内层循环累加（O(nq)）却声明 O(n+q)；用例 q 恰好小","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
{"question":{"id":"GA015","scene":"algorithm","title":"输入 n 个整数，每行输出一个数的平方。","prompt":"输入 n 个整数，每行输出一个数的平方。","difficulty":"basic","source":"自编","source_id":null,"layer_basis":"","standard_answer":"4\n9","reference_solution":null,"test_cases":[{"input":"2\n2 3","output":"4\n9","hidden":false}],"metadata":{"golden":true}},"flaw_answer":{"steps":[{"id":1,"kind":"understand","content":"每行一个","conclusion":"换行分隔","deps":[]},{"id":2,"kind":"approach","content":"平方后输出","conclusion":"O(n)","deps":[1]},{"id":3,"kind":"implement","content":"print(' '.join(str(x*x) for x in a))","conclusion":"输出","deps":[2]},{"id":4,"kind":"selftest","content":"2 → 4","conclusion":"通过","deps":[3]}],"final_answer":"4","code":null},"flaw_type":"format","construction_note":"陷阱把全部结果 print(' '.join(...)) 输出在一行，宣称符合要求；恰好用例 n=1 时单行与多行相同","expected_verdict":"SILENT_FAILURE"}
